 "title": "Electric utilities, standardized",
 "hook": "“Electric utilities report a huge amount of information to the US government,” but “much of this data is not released in well documented, ready-to-use, machine readable formats.” That assessment comes from the Public Utility Data Liberation (PUDL) project, which aims to clean, standardize, and cross-link the electric utility information gathered by various agencies.",
